dlxqwIOAcRrx53AvXy4wySC2ACROcN4YsXnKNExEhgIJrNW52zkGCLO-FU1Zx69plc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyYCAhYeyYv4Azt0xIL53qFTOatWkO1332WqeabpMnwMQ&oe=69B2CA37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jXDcr06XDB0Q7kNvwHUgYHr&_nc_oc=AdlNqRHF0xnFFR6Xo5mqWlb1vqcts22MnzYvBButQ8C_JXF5wtpgAk_yybxJUIjuE90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx6NmEh9l6wgAHAz8JWkux0bOIlI6J9iFHZHPjHGg6ZdQ&oe=69B2CBCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kdw8qvRiOPsQ7kNvwHRYFWB&_nc_oc=Adn8pA3iBLrmIFn6UGGGgxYIv3KH-aSGbRWxBCzdJTojd6M6lH9s1lk8_JbM3yjGpVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy5YGYoype1UfOvzbSED18lr42PO3JUbtZ2PtTWbkgBVw&oe=69B2B8EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HAQwQHXqvjYQ7kNvwGO9SiP&_nc_oc=AdnvxOXo7KifPsZYrFCNCpld01rlPpHtHCakf6ze-ZYy-npn28-nZsgGWhFKzIMYkWs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwOcXoXuFMnjObMqByxz6_7IyZrRpL2L5RrP1tkigUEhg&oe=69B2A243"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y2wvuMqBRC8Q7kNvwFwyB7Q&_nc_oc=AdnxhB7TltymDKKNIhUbEfEfnmP5LCnmbcMnS-svkmRsaSozkJMiPywt8qjvESWDnLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy85NRN39KnJGnSKw6JCImw0Yyq5HQYPvz1CS4-k0yaOA&oe=69B29A98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hCTB3xywk5gQ7kNvwHGsFsc&_nc_oc=AdlyBTiJxGw8DR7b2x_sr1LZxUSzkNZjU4JnChXinX_hhS2PGoja3DM0XED1yVk8WNs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy-1rdsWtZOXHrbKtd3Veet2kdvLWMqLEZx5hMVYaoCrQ&oe=69B2ADBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&