2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OV2c4yrbYLMQ7kNvwF0vdTz&_nc_oc=AdlxqwIOAcRrx53AvXy4wySC2ACROcN4YsXnKNExEhgIJrNW52zkGCLO-FU1Zx69plc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyYCAhYeyYv4Azt0xIL53qFTOatWkO1332WqeabpMnwMQ&oe=69B2CA37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jXDcr06XDB0Q7kNvwHUgYHr&_nc_oc=AdlNqRHF0xnFFR6Xo5mqWlb1vqcts22MnzYvBButQ8C_JXF5wtpgAk_yybxJUIjuE90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx6NmEh9l6wgAHAz8JWkux0bOIlI6J9iFHZHPjHGg6ZdQ&oe=69B2CBCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kdw8qvRiOPsQ7kNvwHRYFWB&_nc_oc=Adn8pA3iBLrmIFn6UGGGgxYIv3KH-aSGbRWxBCzdJTojd6M6lH9s1lk8_JbM3yjGpVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy5YGYoype1UfOvzbSED18lr42PO3JUbtZ2PtTWbkgBVw&oe=69B2B8EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 